WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.299
Maya pulls Alex aside to give feedback

2
00:00:02.299 --> 00:00:04.145
on something that needs to improve.

3
00:00:04.145 --> 00:00:06.293
The message is not harsh, but it is

4
00:00:06.293 --> 00:00:09.753
direct —and Alex did not see it coming.

5
00:00:09.753 --> 00:00:12.864
Almost everyone gets corrected at work at some point.

6
00:00:12.864 --> 00:00:15.256
The real question is whether Alex treats the

7
00:00:15.256 --> 00:00:18.333
moment like a personal insult, or like useful

8
00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:20.666
information that can help build trust.
